          "_name": "header02",
          "_sourceTheme": "beveragem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header2\" group=\"Headers\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\">\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/beveragem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#1a449a\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"wave-container\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-top\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 1600 40\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 1600 40;\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                .st0 {\n                    fill: #1A449A;\n                }\n            </style>\n            <path class=\"st0\" d=\"M-1,15.7c200.1,0,200.7,13.8,400.9,13.8C600,29.5,600.4,9.3,800.5,9.3S998.8,36.8,1199,36.8\n                s201.9-21.1,402-21.1v24.1L-1,40V15.7z\"></path>\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper m-auto\">\n                <img class=\"w-100 md-pb\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/anna-35-998x998.png\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg m-auto\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Discover our world of beverages</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        Elias. Det var en fin fågel som satt på stenen. Jag kollade i mobilen och det blev en fin bild. Fågeln får mig att fundera över hur man får en distanskurs att flyga. Min uppfattning är att det krävs djupa kunskaper inom IT, media och lärande för att bygga en attraktiv distanskurs.&nbsp;<br><br>Man kan använda distanskurser för att sprida information och kunskap om aktuella samhällsfrågor som heder, rasism och hållbar utveckling. Tyvärr kan distanskurser användas för att sprida desinformation. Desinformation skadar individens möjligheter och samhället i stort.&nbsp;<br><br>Det är viktigt att vara källkritisk till den information man använder när man bygger distanskurser. Lika viktigt är att studenter är kritiska till det innehåll som levereras i en distanskurs. Artificiell intelligens kommer demokratisera skapandet av utbildningsmaterial på gott och ont. Fler kommer att kunna skapa distanskurser men fler kommer också kunna använda artificiell intelligens för att skapa desinformation som kan spridas via utbildningar online.&nbsp;</p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">READ MORE</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
          "_cid": "v6XlFqa4tS",
          "_anchor": "header02-b",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "header03",
          "_sourceTheme": "beveragem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header3\" group=\"Headers\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\"\n            condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\"\n            condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\">\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/beveragem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f8f8f8\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\"\n            condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\"\n            condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\"\n        bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"wave-container\">\n        <svg class=\"svg-top\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\n            x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 1600 40\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 1600 40;\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                .st0 {\n                    fill: #1A449A;\n                }\n            </style>\n            <path class=\"st0\" d=\"M-1,15.7c200.1,0,200.7,13.8,400.9,13.8C600,29.5,600.4,9.3,800.5,9.3S998.8,36.8,1199,36.8\n                s201.9-21.1,402-21.1v24.1L-1,40V15.7z\"></path>\n        </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper m-auto\">\n                <img class=\"w-100 md-pb\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/5.svg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg m-auto\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"\n                        mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Unique recipes for cocktails and drinks</b>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"\n                        data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nam congue velit ac risus maximus\n                        blandit. Integer vel velit nec libero pulvinar volutpat nontellus. Proin non sem a nulla aliquet\n                        dictum.</p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a\n                            class=\"btn btn-lg btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\"\n                            data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">READ MORE</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
